<LegalPage title="Cookie Notice" lastUpdated="November 5, 2026">
  <p>
    This notice explains how Archdrill uses cookies and similar technologies. “We” means{" "}
    <strong>Gabeyre Global Inc</strong>, Ontario, Canada.
  </p>

  <h2>What are cookies?</h2>
  <p>
    Cookies are small text files stored on your device by your browser. They are commonly used to remember preferences,
    keep you signed in, and understand how a site is used.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies we use</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Strictly necessary (session) cookies.</strong> We use session cookies to keep you signed in. These are managed
      by our authentication provider, Supabase, and are required for the service to work. They are not used for advertising.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not use advertising, targeting, or third-party tracking cookies.</p>

  <h2>Analytics without cookies</h2>
  <p>
    We use PostHog for product analytics. Our PostHog integration is configured to run <strong>without cookies</strong>,
    using non-cookie identifiers for aggregate analysis. PostHog processes this data in the United States.
  </p>

  <h2>No consent banner</h2>
  <p>
    Because we do not use advertising or tracking cookies, we do not display a cookie consent banner. You can still
    control cookies and similar technologies through your browser settings.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Opt out of analytics:</strong> email <a href="mailto:support@archdrill.com">support@archdrill.com</a> to opt
      out of PostHog analytics, or enable “Do Not Track” in your browser.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Manage cookies:</strong> you can delete or block cookies in your browser settings. Blocking session cookies
      will prevent you from staying signed in.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Learn more about PostHog’s data practices at{" "}
    <a href="https://posthog.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">posthog.com/privacy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Contact us at <a href="mailto:support@archdrill.com">support@archdrill.com</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
